# The Long Way to the Well
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
Do not slow down before I ask.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
I was watching the road.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
You were watching me.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Is that so terrible?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Only if it means you miss the flowers.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
At the well she rests, and tells you which seeds she wants to plant.
